WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:07.674
- The story of "Little Voice" is Bess and
people around Bess finding their voice.

00:00:07.758 --> 00:00:09.384
- I just don't have that thing.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.304
- You're way too hard on yourself.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.473
- We knew, obviously, this was
going to be a story,

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:15.599
this young woman
growing up in New York,

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.018
and that meant it had to
look like it does,

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.020
which is to say a cast that
looks like the city.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:23.649
Every background, every color,
every religion, every sexual orientation.

00:00:24.525 --> 00:00:27.069
- There is something so magical
about their chemistry.

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:30.280
You really felt like there was
a deep sense of trust between them.

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:33.033
- It was just a really
warm, familial set,

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:35.077
and that's the kind of set
that I like to create.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.119
- We're in this together.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:40.207
- My character Prisha is a musician
struggling in New York city,

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.501
and she's also coming to terms
with her sexuality.

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:45.379
- Who you are isn't a choice.
It's who you are.

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:47.548
- That's part of the reason why
I wanted to play Ethan.

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:49.842
He experienced, actually,
quite horrible hardships,

00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:52.594
and what's so nice about him
is how hopeful he is.

00:00:52.678 --> 00:00:54.972
And that's what the show is, isn't it?
It's about finding the courage

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.641
to do what you believe in,
and to not be led astray.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:58.809
- I think I'm just scared.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.435
- Everybody's scared.

00:01:00.519 --> 00:01:04.606
- ♪ There is enough,
so ask for more ♪

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:05.691
- You... got to do this.

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:08.318
- We're just this young,
diverse group of people

00:01:08.402 --> 00:01:10.362
trying to find our footing, not
just in New York, but in life.

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.032
We all have a lot of heart,

00:01:14.116 --> 00:01:15.909
and we all love what we do,
and it shows.

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:16.785
Whoo!

00:01:16.869 --> 00:01:19.204
- We've had such a wide range
of incredible actors

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:21.331
portraying the characters
and what they go through.

00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:22.666
How do we get to Neverland?

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:25.586
- Second star to the right and
straight on 'til morning.

00:01:25.669 --> 00:01:28.213
You just gain a new friendship
along the way,

00:01:28.297 --> 00:01:31.175
with all these different
personalities coming together as one.

00:01:31.258 --> 00:01:33.302
It makes the show feel complete.

00:01:33.385 --> 00:01:34.511
Take it away, Bess.

00:01:35.304 --> 00:01:36.847
- ♪ There is enough ♪

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.265
- It's been really
eye-opening for me

00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:39.892
in being pushed into the deep end
with this show.

00:01:39.975 --> 00:01:41.810
And it's the kind of magic you
don't find all the time.

00:01:41.894 --> 00:01:43.478
- You find the people
who believe in you,

00:01:43.562 --> 00:01:45.772
and it helps you
believe in yourself at times,

00:01:45.856 --> 00:01:47.566
and I think that's
a really beautiful way

00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:49.610
for us to engage with each other
and the world.

00:01:49.693 --> 00:01:52.112
- We're on our own now.
This is our time.

00:01:52.738 --> 00:01:54.948
- ♪ I want more ♪

